{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>בני האלהים.</b> The sons of the judges who carried out the judgment of Elohim on earth. Some say that האלהים in this place is holy, and \"the sons\" are the holy ones who are on earth, in the sense of \"You are sons\" (Deuteronomy 14:1). Some say that בני האלהים are the sons of Seth, and בנות האדם are the daughters of the family of Cain. And it seems right to me that בני האלהים are those who know the knowledge of the Most High; they chose for themselves women, each one according to the arrangement of the heavens suited to each one, and the offspring were like the offspring — therefore mighty men came forth from them. And it is possible that they also took the women by force."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {0 "The phrase מערכת שמים (\"arrangement of the heavens\") is rendered literally; its precise astrological sense is left opaque as in the original."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:25.792546362Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}